<fw type="sig" place="bottom">E 2</fw>           <lb/>
<pb n="68" facs="#f0086"/>
<div n="3">             <head>1725.</head>             <lb/>
<p>Die drei Engla&#x0364;nder: Lord <hi rendition="#g">Derwentwater</hi>,<lb/>
